---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Alojamiento — Capachica">
  <style>
    .aloj-page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #071826 0%, #0a1f30 100%);
      color: #f4f7fb;
      padding-top: 5rem;
    }
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    }
    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(27,166,217,0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(27,166,217,0.3);
      color: #53d3ff;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f4f7fb 40%, #53d3ff);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #8faabb;
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .tipos {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 0 1.5rem 3rem;
    }
    .tipo-btn {
      padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(27,166,217,0.25);
      background: rgba(27,166,217,0.08);
      color: #b9c8d6;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      cursor: default;
    }
    .tipo-btn.activo {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1ba6d9, #0b6ea8);
      color: #fff;
      border-color: transparent;
    }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 1.5rem 3rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(120,200,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    }
    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: rgba(27,166,217,0.3);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(27,166,217,0.1);
    }
    .card-img {
      height: 180px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 3.5rem;
    }
    .card-body { padding: 1.4rem; }
    .card-body h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #f4f7fb;
      margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
    }
    .card-location {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: #53d3ff;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
    .card-body p {
      font-size: 0.87rem;
      color: #7f95aa;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }
    .amenities {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .amenity {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: #8faabb;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .precio {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 0.3rem;
    }
    .precio-num {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #53d3ff;
    }
    .precio-label { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #7f95aa; }
    .cta-section {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(120,200,255,0.08);
    }
    .cta-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }
    .cta-section p {
      color: #8faabb;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .btn-cta {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1ba6d9, #0b6ea8);
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(27,166,217,0.35);
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-cta:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(27,166,217,0.45);
    }
  </style>

  <div class="aloj-page">
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-tag">🏡 Hospedaje Auténtico</div>
      <h1>Alojamiento en Capachica</h1>
      <p>Duerme en casa de familias quechuas, despierta con vista al Titicaca y vive Capachica desde adentro.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tipos">
      <span class="tipo-btn activo">Todos</span>
      <span class="tipo-btn">Familia Anfitriona</span>
      <span class="tipo-btn">Lodge</span>
      <span class="tipo-btn">Hostal</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-img" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a2537, #1565c0)">🏡</div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Familia Quispe — Llachón</h3>
          <div class="card-location">📍 Comunidad de Llachón</div>
          <p>Hospedaje vivencial con la familia Quispe. Desayuno y cena incluidos con productos del lago y la chacra propia.</p>
          <div class="amenities">
            <span class="amenity">🍽 Comidas incluidas</span>
            <span class="amenity">🌅 Vista al lago</span>
            <span class="amenity">🚣 Paseo en bote</span>
          </div>
          <div class="precio">
            <span class="precio-num">S/ 80</span>
            <span class="precio-label">/ persona / noche</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-img" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2a0a, #33691e)">🌿</div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Familia Mamani — Escallani</h3>
          <div class="card-location">📍 Comunidad de Escallani</div>
          <p>Rodeados de totorales y aves silvestres. La señora Mamani enseña tejido tradicional a sus huéspedes por las mañanas.</p>
          <div class="amenities">
            <span class="amenity">🎨 Taller de tejido</span>
            <span class="amenity">🦆 Avistamiento</span>
            <span class="amenity">🐟 Pesca</span>
          </div>
          <div class="precio">
            <span class="precio-num">S/ 70</span>
            <span class="precio-label">/ persona / noche</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-img" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d1b2a, #1ba6d9)">⛵</div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Lodge Titicaca View</h3>
          <div class="card-location">📍 Capachica Centro</div>
          <p>Cabaña privada con baño propio y terraza con vista panorámica al lago. Ideal para parejas y viajeros independientes.</p>
          <div class="amenities">
            <span class="amenity">🛁 Baño privado</span>
            <span class="amenity">🏔 Terraza panorámica</span>
            <span class="amenity">☕ Desayuno</span>
          </div>
          <div class="precio">
            <span class="precio-num">S/ 150</span>
            <span class="precio-label">/ habitación / noche</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-img" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2a0a1a, #880e4f)">🌄</div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Hostal Amanecer Andino</h3>
          <div class="card-location">📍 Capachica Centro</div>
          <p>Hostal familiar con habitaciones compartidas y privadas. Perfecta base para explorar toda la península con guías locales.</p>
          <div class="amenities">
            <span class="amenity">🗺 Guías locales</span>
            <span class="amenity">🚲 Alquiler de bici</span>
            <span class="amenity">📶 Wifi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="precio">
            <span class="precio-num">S/ 45</span>
            <span class="precio-label">/ persona / noche</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-img" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1a2a, #004d7a)">🏘️</div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Familia Ccama — Chifrón</h3>
          <div class="card-location">📍 Bahía de Chifrón</div>
          <p>Directamente a orillas de la bahía. Incluye kayak libre y sesión de pesca artesanal al amanecer con el señor Ccama.</p>
          <div class="amenities">
            <span class="amenity">🚣 Kayak libre</span>
            <span class="amenity">🌅 Amanecer en bote</span>
            <span class="amenity">🍽 Pensión completa</span>
          </div>
          <div class="precio">
            <span class="precio-num">S/ 95</span>
            <span class="precio-label">/ persona / noche</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-img" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a0a, #827717)">⭐</div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Casa Rural Pachamama</h3>
          <div class="card-location">📍 Llachón Alta</div>
          <p>La opción más completa de la península. Habitaciones amplias, restaurante con cocina novoandina y spa de medicina ancestral.</p>
          <div class="amenities">
            <span class="amenity">💆 Spa andino</span>
            <span class="amenity">🍷 Restaurante</span>
            <span class="amenity">🌿 Medicina ancestral</span>
          </div>
          <div class="precio">
            <span class="precio-num">S/ 220</span>
            <span class="precio-label">/ habitación / noche</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-section">
      <h2>¿Quieres reservar?</h2>
      <p>Contacta directamente con las familias anfitrionas o usa nuestro sistema de reservas.</p>
      <a href="/actividades" class="btn-cta">Ver actividades incluidas →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
